When it gets here I’ll be doing bonus videos,
reviews, Q&amp;As and the weekly giveaway, just

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:12.880
like last year.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:13.880
So be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:21.640
I’ll do a couple more bonus videos before
then, including the michonne one I keep postponing.

